# Route the @jrmoulckers scope to GitHub Packages, and nothing else.
#
# Do not replace the default registry wholesale (`registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com/`):
# GitHub Packages implements no audit endpoint, and npm resolves it as
# `auditRegistry || registry`, so `npm audit` would fail with an endpoint error that no
# token can fix.
#
# No _authToken line here on purpose. CI supplies it via setup-node at user level, and a
# local token belongs in ~/.npmrc.
@jrmoulckers:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
